### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Team Meeting",
  "date": "2026-02-12"
}

### List events
GET http://localhost:3000/events

### Submit availability (replace with real event id)
POST http://localhost:3000/events/REPLACE_EVENT_ID/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ava",
  "timeSlot": "Tue 3pm"
}

### List availability
GET http://localhost:3000/events/REPLACE_EVENT_ID/availability

### Submit availability for fake event id, expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/events/not-a-real-id/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ava",
  "timeSlot": "Tue 3pm"
}
